3. APPROVE with suggestions (no allow, no maxThreadLimit) → overridden to REQUEST_CHANGES → In Rework move.
4. Dispatch-race guard: forceApproveDueToThreadLimit (maxReviewThreadsBeforeForceApprove + countReviewThreads ≥ limit) → approved despite suggestions.
5. Re-review: ai_pr_reviewed/agent:review label handling on PR-anchored runs.
6. WIP label removal, removeLabel, assignTo initiator.
7. pr_info.md parsing (number/url/branch/author).
8. autoStartRework (config → triggerConfiguredWorkflowForTicket called; pr_approved label skip; stripKeys).

These pin the paths I'm extracting. New pure helpers get direct unit tests.

