Original loop body order:
1. 'diff --git ' → reset all + pendingLeftMatch
2. '--- a/' → oldFile (null if /dev/null)
3. '+++ b/' → currentFile
4. '+++ /dev/null' → currentFile = oldFile
5. currentFile !== filePath → skip line
6. hunk regex → set oldLine/newLine
7. oldLine===null || newLine===null → skip
8. '+' → RIGHT match at newLine / newLine++
9. '-' → pendingLeftMatch at oldLine / oldLine++
10. ' → RIGHT at newLine, LEFT at oldLine / both++
11. '\ No newline' → skip
12. else → both++

